    "title": "La Casa de los Famosos 6 and Big Brother Argentina set for contestant swap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sindhura Venkatesh ,\n35 minutes ago La Casa de los Famosos 6 will include a short exchange with the reality show Big Brother Argentina. The update was shared by host Santiago del Moro, who said the change will happen “for a few days.” One contestant from each show will move into the other house for a limited time. Both shows have a similar setup. Contestants live in the same house, have no contact with the outside world, and take part in nominations and eliminations. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
